        <Text52 Ref="96" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,7.5,7.4,0.9</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Expressions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,8</Font>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text52</Name>
          <Page isRef="8" />
          <Parent isRef="8" />
          <Text> "Received by the Carrier the Goods as specified above in apparent good order and condition unless otherwise stated, to be transported 
to such place as agreed, authorised or permitted herein and subject to all the terms and conditions appearing on the front and reverse of 
this Bill of Lading to which the Merchant agrees by accepting this Bill of Lading, any local privileges and customs notwithstanding. The 
particulars given above as stated by the shipper and the weight, measure, quality, condition, content and value of the Goods are 
unknown to the Carrier. In WITNESS whereof one (1) original Bill of Lading has been signed if not otherwise stated above, the same 
being accomplished the other(s), if any, to be void required by the Carrier one (1) original Bill of Lading must be surrendered duly 
endorsed in exchange for the Goods or delivered order
</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text52>
